    "detailed_description": "Amidst an interstellar conflict, Earth has found itself trapped in the crossfire. Under relentless attack, humanity's only hope for survival lies in a daring escape into space. A colony ship embarks on a perilous journey through enemy lines, tasked with finding and securing a new homeland in safer territories. You are entrusted with the vital mission of safely escorting this vessel and leading this mission to success. Cynically dubbed &quot;The Last Mission&quot; by some, it may indeed be humanity\u2019s final chance.<br><br>The Last Mission is an auto-battler and space battle simulation game where you command a fleet of spacecraft in vast, strategic battles. Equip, configure and upgrade your ships to be ready to battle the enemy.<br><br><strong>Build Your Fleet</strong><br>Discover the strengths and weaknesses of a variety of unique ships\u2014from nimble fighters to massive battleships. Arm them with a diverse array of weapon and support modules, and combine their abilities to maximize your firepower in battle.<br><br><strong>Command Your Fleet</strong><br>Strategically position your fleet on the battlefield and assign commands to each ship. Destroy your enemies from a safe distance, or sow chaos with a swift advance into enemy lines.<br><br><strong>Watch Your Fleet in Action</strong><br>Once preparations are complete, the battle begins. Observe as your plans and strategies unfold on the battlefield, with laser beams slicing through the air and machine guns rattling.",
